/-- Given [the stated mathematical inputs and assumptions](hyp:ε,J,g,hOverlap,x,y,z,s,hs0,hs1,u), this result [establishes the stated mathematical conclusion](goal). -/
lemma scoreLogTriplePerturbedFullLaw_scoreMarginal {ε : ℝ} {J : ℕ}
