/-- Given [the stated mathematical inputs and assumptions](hyp:ε,J,g,x,y,z,s), this result [establishes the stated mathematical conclusion](goal). -/
lemma scoreLogTripleBaselineFullLaw_consistency {ε : ℝ} {J : ℕ}
